{"about_the_game":"Players will board a train and lead their team through the land of madness and desolation. And you will need to make supply runs during the treacherous journey, surviving while already fallen into despair. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/3916aa244ad6f69caacb5fc7a4a3d68e.avif?t=1729049405\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/ee01651ddb325ac0576bae54b3c78634.poster.avif?t=1729049405\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/ee01651ddb325ac0576bae54b3c78634.webm?t=1729049405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/ee01651ddb325ac0576bae54b3c78634.mp4?t=1729049405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Make sure you are ready to face those sinister creatures.<br>Bosses will end your pathetic lives with no hesitation.   <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/399e96f226cdb0e0c9170540cb18a206.avif?t=1729049405\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/5a5d6d2d57f91f532b6efc6d734d2148.poster.avif?t=1729049405\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/5a5d6d2d57f91f532b6efc6d734d2148.webm?t=1729049405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/5a5d6d2d57f91f532b6efc6d734d2148.mp4?t=1729049405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Navigate in skirmish and attack the enemy using a crushing blow.<br>Conquer the unknown or be conquered by it, nobody knows the answer...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/b8c3fd55421f0318b23d605868b52286.avif?t=1729049405\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/f2eeff743b3b6927613be6bf5cf9d8e7.poster.avif?t=1729049405\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/f2eeff743b3b6927613be6bf5cf9d8e7.webm?t=1729049405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/f2eeff743b3b6927613be6bf5cf9d8e7.mp4?t=1729049405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The locomotive is connected to 12 different types of carriages, it\u2019s the only sanctuary in this world of madness.<br>Get away from this ominous land, find a safe place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/23125a687f99ae865bfe732e2fad3e81.avif?t=1729049405\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/8d7547f2c79c968b1772da51d74eeb6b.poster.avif?t=1729049405\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/8d7547f2c79c968b1772da51d74eeb6b.webm?t=1729049405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/8d7547f2c79c968b1772da51d74eeb6b.mp4?t=1729049405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Meet other survivors, 5 classes with unique deck builds.<br>What\u2019s your choice, a soldier to fight with your? Or a backup stationed on the train?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/aedc42ed619271e2a2e67e839f5c0b2d.avif?t=1729049405\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/8b20e1396359ba49b242bb47b1d7e900.poster.avif?t=1729049405\" width=600 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/8b20e1396359ba49b242bb47b1d7e900.webm?t=1729049405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/extras/8b20e1396359ba49b242bb47b1d7e900.mp4?t=1729049405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Pairing two of the five combat styles, there are more than 120 card building combinations.<br>Find your meta combinations, so your venture may last longer...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prologue content:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Assemble your vanguard squad by recruiting survivors with different classes. <br></li><li>Explore the first location, challenge 2 wicked bosses!<br></li><li>Learn about soldiers and engineers\u2019 vital role on the journey!</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2006990?t=1729049405","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1729049405","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1729049405","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006990/capsule_184x69